# NOTE: chroma_db/ is intentionally NOT ignored.
# app/langgraph_services/nodes.py builds the retriever at import time
# (module-level `retriever = get_retriever()`), and embedding.py's
# get_retriever() calls OpenAI embeddings immediately if ./chroma_db is
# missing -- so without a prebuilt chroma_db in the image, the server
# fails to start unless a real OPENAI_API_KEY is present.
